    {
      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "0aaa66bcfca3189a",
      "query": "{\"strategic_intent\": \"Check the committed statpack and reconstruct the statpack build the candidates ran against to verify their base-rate citations.\", \"summary\": \"I have inspected the case record, outcome.json, and all three blinded candidate submissions (claude-baseline, gemini-baseline, and codex-baseline). Because all three candidates ran on 2026-10-31 under salience version sal-v6 (statpack digest sha256:a059cb87...) while the current working tree uses sal-v8, I will now inspect metrics/statpack.md an",
